abstract: "Benchmark results, deployment manifests, and process management controllers evaluating Qwen3.8-27B 4-bit with DFlash2 speculative decoding and L1 in-memory prefix caching on Apple Silicon (M4 Max 64GB). Includes analysis of speculative acceptance rates, prefix caching trade-offs, and measurement caveats."
